	I've been playing my best game ever, and I happened to notice
that while killing krakens in hell, if I have a blindfold on, the Xp's
increase by only 1, but if the blindfold is off, I get ~800 Xp's for
the kill.  I tried this on other monsters too, and the same thing
happened.  Does the game think killing monsters with a blindfold and
telepathy is not worth as much as a straight-out, toe-to-toe fight?

